    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tariffs cover 50% operational costs by December 2016. 
Progress/Status: As of 31 May 2018, the total electricity tariff revenue for the financial year 2017/2018 was A$1.36 million, whereas the corresponding operation cost was A$1.39 million. This shows that tariff revenue were almost breakeven to the operational costs by 31 May 2018. 
